OL,3,GNEWSAThe town whose council wants
OL,4,Amigrants to move in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new shop opened along Greenock's
OL,7,Ffading High Street in May. Anik African
OL,8,FStore has brought a small corner of
OL,9,FNigeria to the Scottish town, selling
OL,10,Fyams, plantain, okra and catfish.
OL,12,FIt is not the only African food shop
OL,13,Fhere - there is another just metres
OL,14,Faway, responding to the area's changing
OL,15,Fpopulation.
OL,17,FFive years ago, locals say, it would
OL,18,Fhave been rare to see a black person in
OL,19,FGreenock. Now hundreds of Africans and
OL,20,Frefugees have moved to the area.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
