OL,3,GNEWSAThe town whose council wants
OL,4,Amigrants to move in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local council has in fact come up
OL,7,Fwith a plan to attract even more to
OL,8,Fthis corner of the west of Scotland as
OL,9,Fa means of stemming its falling
OL,10,Fpopulation.
